<title>UK: Rheinboden Hypo sets 250 mln mark bond.</title>
<headline>Rheinboden Hypo sets 250 mln mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Sal Oppenheim and SGZ Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RHEINBODEN HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DEM   COUPON     *4.0	MATURITY  **05.MAR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.90    PAY DATE    05.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    DDF	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR YEAR ONE, 4.25 PCT IN YEAR TWO, 4.75 PCT IN</p>
<p>		 YEAR THREE, 5.0 PCT IN YEAR FOUR AND 6.50 PCT IN</p>
<p>		 YEAR FIVE</p>
<p>	     **CALLABLE IN YEARS TWO, THREE AND FOUR</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 GOV LAW     GERMAN</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.75	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES662</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
